  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/cbd9369b-9c4f-4e02-83e5-9038c36d96a4.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.97986in;height:1.69375in\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, required area <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
